{"id":"90ce6acf0c65af45","group":"58","path":"58/batch08/58-df-theory.md","title":"Theory","display":"df-theory — Theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-theory","aliases":["58-df-theory","Theory","Axiomatic Theory"],"display":"df-theory — Theory","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-theory</span><span>Theory</span><span>Axiomatic Theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-theory — Theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma,\\Gamma\\in V\">\\(\\Sigma,\\Gamma\\in V\\)</span> (first-order signature and formula collection)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\subseteq V\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (language-indexed theory predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{Theory}(\\Gamma,\\Sigma) \\leftrightarrow \\Gamma \\subseteq \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{Theory}(\\Gamma,\\Sigma) \\leftrightarrow \\Gamma \\subseteq \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 是语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 中的一个理论（一阶公式集合）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma \\models \\varphi\">\\(\\Gamma \\models \\varphi\\)</span> : 理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 语义蕴涵公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> : 理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 是协调的（无矛盾）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma \\vdash \\varphi\">\\(\\Gamma \\vdash \\varphi\\)</span> : 理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 语法推导出公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>完全理论: 对每个句子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>，要么 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma \\vdash \\varphi\">\\(\\Gamma \\vdash \\varphi\\)</span> 要么 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma \\vdash \\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\Gamma \\vdash \\neg\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Enderton, A Mathematical Introduction to Logic, §2.5</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\subseteq V$ (formula set, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma,\\Gamma\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{Theory}(\\Gamma,\\Sigma) \\leftrightarrow \\Gamma \\subseteq \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma \\models \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma \\vdash \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma \\vdash \\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma \\vdash \\neg\\varphi","display":false}],"bytes":1133,"backlinks":[{"id":"7cadc4ab36b41124","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"68fd6aebcf2cd4ac","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$\\Gamma \\subseteq \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)$ (假设集/理论, see [[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]])"},{"id":"a1d58436755c6bc6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c08fdddee419d91f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"36d7982292843823","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T$ (理论, see [[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]])"},{"id":"967fd715c999aad8","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a4d3c71685246c85","anchor":"ref-9","locations":[